iterations.reply:
I left out the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and an interface that is not granted cannot be imported. A grant change that is not yet in the graph definition does not change what the component is allowed to link. The fetch would also send each item's text to an external host, which is a data disclosure the graph does not authorize. The output-preserving enrichment cannot be made safe here, so the body is unchanged apart from the removed fetch.

